    {
      "id": "flows",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 560,
      "y": 1640,
      "width": 1000,
      "height": 280.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 699199910,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 960836460,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1760000000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "FLOWS  (verified = observed in telemetry-map / compatibility, otherwise labelled)\nF1  Browser -> kubectl port-forward (8082 harness / 8081 demo-ui) -> pod. Shared bearer token. VERIFIED.\nF2  harness -> local-model, OpenAI-compatible /v1 tool calling (in-cluster, no real credential). VERIFIED, n=1 chat turn (0.14).\nF3  harness tool -> A2A SendMessage (JSON-RPC, bearer, A2A-Version 1.0) -> facade audit / enforced. VERIFIED (0.13, 0.14).\nF4  facade -> Foundry Responses (store=False, get_openai_client(agent_name=...), Entra token of the demo-ui workload identity,\n      Foundry Agent Consumer role) -> hosted agent. Calls SUCCEED (observed). Network path (AKS -> private endpoint) is ASSUMED from\n      'data plane reachable only from inside the VNet'; the managed-VNet vs egress-policy layering is an open doc gap (compat. D).\nF5  hosted agent get_servicing_policy -> policy-api: egress decision Allow + receipt (both modes). VERIFIED.\nF6  send_to_external_processor -> test-receiver. Audit: AuditWouldDeny row + request reaches + receipt. Enforced: Deny/DefaultDeny\n      row (Enforced, NoMatchingAllowRule), NO receipt. VERIFIED, B/C PASS (small n).\nF7  Platform egress decision rows (AppDependencies, NetworkEgressDecision) -> App Insights; written by the platform, not our code. VERIFIED.\nF8  policy-api / test-receiver stdout receipts -> Log Analytics ContainerAppConsoleLogs_CL. VERIFIED.\nF9  Agent telemetry export to App Insights: enforced run shows Deny/DefaultDeny rows (observed); link to missing app spans NOT VERIFIED.\nF10 verify_demo.py B/C, kql-queries.md and the workbook (PROPOSED, not applied) read evidence by run-... id. verify: VERIFIED.\nF11 task build:* -> ACR; ACR -> AKS image pull; ACR -> hosted-agent image (one digest); agent-harness init container publishes both versions.",
      "originalText": "FLOWS  (verified = observed in telemetry-map / compatibility, otherwise labelled)\nF1  Browser -> kubectl port-forward (8082 harness / 8081 demo-ui) -> pod. Shared bearer token. VERIFIED.\nF2  harness -> local-model, OpenAI-compatible /v1 tool calling (in-cluster, no real credential). VERIFIED, n=1 chat turn (0.14).\nF3  harness tool -> A2A SendMessage (JSON-RPC, bearer, A2A-Version 1.0) -> facade audit / enforced. VERIFIED (0.13, 0.14).\nF4  facade -> Foundry Responses (store=False, get_openai_client(agent_name=...), Entra token of the demo-ui workload identity,\n      Foundry Agent Consumer role) -> hosted agent. Calls SUCCEED (observed). Network path (AKS -> private endpoint) is ASSUMED from\n      'data plane reachable only from inside the VNet'; the managed-VNet vs egress-policy layering is an open doc gap (compat. D).\nF5  hosted agent get_servicing_policy -> policy-api: egress decision Allow + receipt (both modes). VERIFIED.\nF6  send_to_external_processor -> test-receiver. Audit: AuditWouldDeny row + request reaches + receipt. Enforced: Deny/DefaultDeny\n      row (Enforced, NoMatchingAllowRule), NO receipt. VERIFIED, B/C PASS (small n).\nF7  Platform egress decision rows (AppDependencies, NetworkEgressDecision) -> App Insights; written by the platform, not our code. VERIFIED.\nF8  policy-api / test-receiver stdout receipts -> Log Analytics ContainerAppConsoleLogs_CL. VERIFIED.\nF9  Agent telemetry export to App Insights: enforced run shows Deny/DefaultDeny rows (observed); link to missing app spans NOT VERIFIED.\nF10 verify_demo.py B/C, kql-queries.md and the workbook (PROPOSED, not applied) read evidence by run-... id. verify: VERIFIED.\nF11 task build:* -> ACR; ACR -> AKS image pull; ACR -> hosted-agent image (one digest); agent-harness init container publishes both versions.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 12
